📥 How to Download

1. Visit our "GitHub Releases" (https://github.com/newu2040-beep/Mero-mayalu-/releases/tag/debug-apk-build-1-1) page.
2. Scroll down to the Assets section.
3. Find and download the latest Mero Mayalu APK.
4. Install the APK and enjoy! ❤️

⚠️ Installation Notice

During installation, Android or Google Play Protect may display a warning because the app is distributed outside the Play Store.

This is an independently distributed APK. Review the installation source and permissions before proceeding. Only install it if you trust the source.

